  by: agent  # e716
  actor: jgstern_agent  # e716
  clock: 8  # e716
  nonce: e716  # e716
  message: "Fixed at the WI-kutas root: generate-schema's Symbol/Edge/Span/AnalysisRun $defs are now introspected from the dataclasses (new scripts/generate_schema_lib.py) instead of hand-coded, so Symbol.language Optional[str] propagates as oneOf[string,null] (dropped from required) — the 262 Class B nodes now validate whole-document (new e2e SQL+Python linker-active conformance test proves it). SCHEMA_VERSION 0.13.0 -> 0.14.0. Both implementer caveats honored: (1) canary moved — new cross_field spec-validator check emits umbrella violations when Class B stand-ins miss stable_id/fingerprint/discovery_language/origin (META-niguz stays visible); (2) ride-along — stale canonical_name property actually deleted from schema.json, making the CHANGELOG §Removed claim true."  # e716
